{"id":"bespolezno","lemma":"бесполезно","pos":"adv","rank":1656,"glosses":["uselessly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/85/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это было бесполезно.","en":"It was useless.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Я знаю, что это бесполезно.","en":"I know it's useless.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,4,"why"]]},{"text":"Бесполезно говорить с ними дальше.","en":"It is no use talking with them any longer.","words":[null,{"g":"to speak, to talk"},{"g":"with / from"},null,{"g":"furthermore"}]},{"text":"У меня бесполезно просить денег.","en":"It's no use asking me for money.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"to ask for, to request"},{"g":"money","l":"деньги"}]},{"text":"Даже пытаться бесполезно.","en":"It's useless to even try.","words":[{"g":"even"},{"g":"to attempt, to try"},null]}]}